id: pm-gh1362
title: "GH-1362: Eval: gate downstream decisions, abstention and task success per token"
description: "Residual SDK contract and acceptance plan imported from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1362. Preserve existing shipped foundations. Detailed source observations are dated 2026-09-30 and must be revalidated before implementation."
