acceptance_criteria: "Changed/superseded decisions change the expected action; stale evidence requires refresh or abstention; Unresolved conflicts and omitted mandatory context cannot pass as confident correct completion; Resume after a confirmed effect does not repeat it; unknown effects require reconciliation; Cross-scope hidden data never improves a score through unauthorized access; A shorter context that drops required evidence fails correctness even if its token count improves; Every mandatory family has nonempty fixtures and independently meaningful pass/fail thresholds; Negative controls deliberately choose the obsolete decision, ignore expiry, replay an effect, omit a category and leak scope; each fails its corresponding gate; Fixed seeds and clocks yield stable deterministic results; optional model evaluation reports variance and configuration; Packed public SDK and CLI/MCP runs consume the same scenario contracts and final output receipts; Documentation includes how to add cases, interpret abstention and update reviewed baselines without weakening safety floors; A negative control confidently completes despite an unresolved assertion conflict and independently fails the conflicting-assertions gate"
